Policy around where you live and work

Our hybrid working environment aims to help you balance working from home and collaborating in the office Work happens Monday to Friday for 8,5 hours each day, including an hour for refuelling for lunch You will be required to be in the office some of these days to connect meaningfully and maximise collaboration with your teams Have a conversation with your line manager if you need to adjust your schedule to navigate other responsibilities, like school drop-offs or pick-ups We’re happy to work with you You’ll live your best work life at one of our office locations: VMLers should live and work in the province where they’re employed (your designated office) But we get it – sometimes things can change If you’re looking to work from a different location than the one you were hired in, you will need to inform us prior to relocating', '[-0.025024952,0.062487155,0.0851049,0.03365079,0.0027896052,0.011747685,0.04157452,-0.0042063487,-0.014167433,0.039668813,-0.013891607,-0.0026940063,0.024235087,-0.02181534,-0.042101096,0.027256636,0.028786218,0.019897094,-0.0070899855,0.019934706,0.01039363,0.05862559,-0.032798234,0.062286556,-0.011446784,0.001810109,-0.029989824,0.018781252,-0.0025921387,-0.031017901,-0.00026994915,-0.019784257,-0.0366598,0.022642817,-0.017790785,0.044733983,0.021627277,-0.0077482066,0.011898137,0.03380124,-0.06955834,0.014167433,0.0490469,0.03239703,-0.034277666,0.046639692,-0.02575213,0.027281713,0.024360463,0.023470296,0.009296594,-0.04869585,-0.034277666,0.012619046,0.009089725,-0.022893569,0.024761664,0.0002529059,0.028510392,0.018405126,0.040646743,-0.03026565,0.054212373,0.051403962,0.011697535,-0.010537812,-0.018242138,-0.003175135,-0.02125115,-0.039142236,0.030165348,0.055115078,0.02400941,-0.01766541,-0.0613337,-0.013653394,0.0008744942,-0.002424449,-0.045335785,-0.044784132,-0.020110233,-0.041398995,0.023871498,0.046113115,-0.025952732,-0.043906506,-0.031218503,-0.020900099,-0.014230121,-0.010519005,0.045611612,0.002650125,-0.03558157,0.0186684