Description of the structure of the VML SA business

VML Business Structure The VML SA business runs on a CLIENT-CENTRIC, FEDERATED model It is comprised of small teams assembled around each client reporting into an Exco and led by a small client leadership team This simple, flat structure ensures that clients are the building blocks that comprise the business and that those clients are as close as possible to the executive team Client Pods Each client has a pod of people linked to it These pods are as fixed as possible meaning that wherever we can people will be dedicated to those clients Even where not dedicated every effort will be made to assign the same people consistently to these clients to enable deep knowledge of the brand and business Pods are not: Business units Squads Tribes Divisions They do not have their own names, culture or strategy They exist to service the client for which they are formed and have a singular purpose: to create joy for that client', '[-0.01673164,0.049180884,0.03482423,0.02932707,0.005680619,0.01723866,0.023402948,0.00892621,0.017372087,-0.011921627,0.020387517,-0.070769235,0.009926907,-0.013676181,-0.024924006,0.022722475,0.03509108,-0.011154427,-0.006344414,0.0027635894,0.060361996,0.021761807,-0.030874813,0.060575478,-0.035678156,0.011654776,-0.04982133,-0.002710219,-0.049581163,-0.030821443,0.060468737,-0.016918438,0.0113412235,0.02687203,-0.049394365,0.019560276,1.0143776e-05,0.039200608,0.004599867,0.03733264,-0.021161389,-0.017118577,0.017678967,0.056839544,0.039654255,0.03634529,-0.031995595,0.023536375,-0.039947793,0.033676762,-0.030928185,-0.0015369026,0.0045098043,0.008585974,-0.052543223,-0.0028786694,0.053770743,-0.034504004,0.005130236,0.018079245,0.0060041775,-0.01438334,0.07034227,0.027512474,0.01626465,-0.018986544,-0.05742662,0.0065412177,0.0060375337,0.0048366985,0.025791276,0.0019013229,-0.031248407,0.008605988,-0.065859154,-0.02443033,-0.030261053,0.0007476035,0.001186659,-0.03693236,0.0032422557,-0.01545075,0.095479764,0.035277877,-0.034904283,-0.017785707,0.013